{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55843","headline":"补迎神奏永和之舞九变第二奏 · 陈致雍","name":"补迎神奏永和之舞九变第二奏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"说祝於室，焫萧燃脂。\n几筵斯设，妥以皇诗。\n云韶清越，绦服离披。\n僾然如此，永感孝思。\n（《大唐郊祀录》卷九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈致雍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}